<view class="container">
  <view class="kicker">思维闯关 · 01</view>
  <view class="title">抓狐狸</view>
  <view class="subtitle">五个洞，一只狐狸。每天只能查一个洞；你查完，狐狸会沿相邻的洞跑掉。路径上有必胜策略，环上却不一定。</view>

  <view class="mode-row">
    <view class="mode {{level === 1 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-level="1" bindtap="setLevel">路径 · P5</view>
    <view class="mode {{level === 2 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-level="2" bindtap="setLevel">环 · C5</view>
  </view>

  <view class="status">
    <text>{{status}}</text>
    <text class="day">第 {{state.day}} / {{state.maxDay}} 天</text>
  </view>

  <view class="holes">
    <view class="hole {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}}" wx:for="{{holes}}" wx:key="label" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="check">
      <text class="hole-num">{{item.label}}</text>
      <text class="hole-icon">{{item.checked ? '✓' : '·'}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="showHint">提示</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="restart">重开</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule">
    <view class="rule-title">为什么路径和环不同</view>
    <view class="rule-text">路径是一条链，从一端向另一端扫，总能把狐狸逼到端点；环没有端点，奇偶性不匹配时可能永远差一格。</view>
  </view>
</view>
